nner\" title=\"macOS · remote\" data-calls=\"[&quot;project.scan()&quot;,&quot;report.write()&quot;]\" data-results=\"[&quot;21 metrics collected&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong title=\"Mac mini\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Mac mini</strong></p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div><div data-node=\"agent\" aria-label=\"Report assistant, session 5, Claude Sonnet\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Agent 5</strong></p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Starting</span></p></div><div data-node=\"runner\" title=\"Linux · cloud\" data-calls=\"[&quot;project.scan()&quot;,&quot;report.write()&quot;]\" data-results=\"[&quot;28 metrics collected&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong title=\"Cloud worker\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Cloud worker</strong></p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div><div data-node=\"agent\" aria-label=\"Report assistant, session 6, Claude Sonnet\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Agent 6</strong></p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Starting</span></p></div><div data-node=\"runner\" title=\"Windows · local\" data-calls=\"[&quot;project.scan()&quot;,&quot;report.write()&quot;]\" data-results=\"[&quot;16 metrics collected&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong title=\"Windows PC\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Windows PC</strong></p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div></div><div data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Each agent reasons and calls tools on its paired runner. Sessions run independently and repeat automatically.</p><p><span data-activity=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Starting sessions…</span></p></div><p><span data-count=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">0 delivered</span></p></div></section></rungrid-task-demo></section><section aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"><rungrid-contact-form data-astro-cid-jbceweda=\"true\"></rungrid-contact-form></section></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><div aria-labelledby=\"operations-title\" data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><header data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h2 id=\"operations-title\" data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">System operations<br data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">across your machines.</span></h2><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Checking computers one by one means repeating instructions and gathering context in separate sessions. Rungrid lets you describe the work once and choose which machines it applies to.</p></header><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><article data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"></span><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Administer multiple computers</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Check installed software versions, inspect service status or review configuration across selected computers without repeating the same request on each machine.</p></div></article><article data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"></span><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Collect machine metrics</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Ask for a snapshot of CPU, memory and disk usage from selected machines to help identify resource pressure and decide where to investigate next.</p></div></article><article data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"></span><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Investigate and address failures</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Select the affected machines and ask agents to inspect logs, check relevant processes and attempt a targeted fix where the available tools allow it.</p></div></article></div></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"architecture-title\"><h2 id=\"architecture-title\" data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">One task. A separate agent for each runner.</h2><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><ol data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Write the instructions</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Create a task describing the work. Attach one reusable <strong data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">agent configuration</strong>: a model and its parameters, not a running agent.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Select the runners</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Attach the runners you want to use. A <strong data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">runner</strong> is a background program on a local machine, not an AI agent.</p></li><li data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Execute the task</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Execution creates a separate <strong data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">agent instance</strong> for each selected runner, using the attached configuration. Each instance uses tools only on its paired runner’s machine.</p></li></ol><figure data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Task: inspect disk usage</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Instructions + one agent configuration</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Model + parameters</span></p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Agent instance 1</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Same configuration</span></p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Tool calls</span></p></div><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Runner 1</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Workstation</span></p></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Agent instance 2</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Same configuration</span></p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Tool calls</span></p></div><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Runner 2</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Build server</span></p></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Agent instance 3</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Same configuration</span></p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Tool calls</span></p></div><p><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Runner 3</span><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Laptop</span></p></div></div><figcaption data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Each agent sends tool calls only to its paired runner. The runner executes them on its own machine.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></DIV>","content_text":"SysOps AI toolRun AI agents at scale on local machines.Control PlaneRoutingAgent 1StartingMacBook ProReadyAgent 2StartingWorkstationReadyAgent 3StartingBuild serverReadyAgent 4StartingMac miniReadyAgent 5StartingCloud workerReadyAgent 6StartingWindows PCReadyEach agent reasons and calls tools on its paired runner. Sessions run independently and repeat automatically.Starting sessions…0 deliveredSystem operationsacross your machines.Checking computers one by one means repeating instructions and gathering context in separate sessions. Rungrid lets you describe the work once and choose which machines it applies to.Administer multiple computersCheck installed software versions, inspect service status or review configuration across selected computers without repeating the same request on each machine.Collect machine metricsAsk for a snapshot of CPU, memory and disk usage from selected machines to help identify resource pressure and decide where to investigate next.Inv