&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p>Build server</p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div><div data-node=\"agent\" aria-label=\"Report assistant, session 4, Claude Sonnet\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Agent 4</strong></p><p>开始</p></div><div data-node=\"runner\" title=\"macOS · remote\" data-calls=\"[&quot;project.scan()&quot;,&quot;report.write()&quot;]\" data-results=\"[&quot;21 metrics collected&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p>Mac mini</p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div><div data-node=\"agent\" aria-label=\"Report assistant, session 5, Claude Sonnet\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Agent 5</strong></p><p>开始</p></div><div data-node=\"runner\" title=\"Linux · cloud\" data-calls=\"[&quot;project.scan()&quot;,&quot;report.write()&quot;]\" data-results=\"[&quot;28 metrics collected&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p>Cloud worker</p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div><div data-node=\"agent\" aria-label=\"Report assistant, session 6, Claude Sonnet\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p><span data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"></span><strong data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Agent 6</strong></p><p>开始</p></div><div data-node=\"runner\" title=\"Windows · local\" data-calls=\"[&quot;project.scan()&quot;,&quot;report.write()&quot;]\" data-results=\"[&quot;16 metrics collected&quot;,&quot;weekly-report.md&quot;]\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p>Windows PC</p><p><span data-node-status=\"\" data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Ready</span></p></div></div><div data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\"><p data-astro-cid-5fkqr45r=\"\">Each agent reasons and calls tools on its paired runner. Sessions run independently and repeat automatically.</p><p>Starting sessions…</p></div><p>0 delivered</p></div></section></rungrid-task-demo></section><section aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\" data-astro-cid-lcdefpme=\"\"><rungrid-contact-form data-astro-cid-jbceweda=\"true\"></rungrid-contact-form></section></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><div aria-labelledby=\"operations-title\" data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><header data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h2 id=\"operations-title\" data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">System operationsacross your machines.</h2><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Checking computers one by one means repeating instructions and gathering context in separate sessions. Rungrid lets you describe the work once and choose which machines it applies to.</p></header><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><article data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"></span><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Administer multiple computers</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Check installed software versions, inspect service status or review configuration across selected computers without repeating the same request on each machine.</p></div></article><article data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"></span><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Collect machine metrics</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Ask for a snapshot of CPU, memory and disk usage from selected machines to help identify resource pressure and decide where to investigate next.</p></div></article><article data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><span data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"></span><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><h3 data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Investigate and address failures</h3><p data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Select the affected machines and ask agents to inspect logs, check relevant processes and attempt a targeted fix where the available tools allow it.</p></div></article></div></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\" aria-labelledby=\"architecture-title\"><h2 id=\"architecture-title\" data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">One task. A separate agent for each runner.</h2><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><ol data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><li data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Write the instructionsCreate a task describing the work. Attach one reusable agent configuration: a model and its parameters, not a running agent.</li><li data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Select the runnersAttach the runners you want to use. A runner is a background program on a local machine, not an AI agent.</li><li data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Execute the taskExecution creates a separate agent instance for each selected runner, using the attached configuration. Each instance uses tools only on its paired runner’s machine.</li></ol><figure data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>Task: inspect disk usageInstructions + one agent configurationModel + parameters</p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>Agent instance 1Same configuration</p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>工具调用</p></div><p>Runner 1Workstation</p></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>Agent instance 2Same configuration</p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>工具调用</p></div><p>Runner 2Build server</p></div><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>Agent instance 3Same configuration</p><div data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\"><p>工具调用</p></div><p>Runner 3Laptop</p></div></div><figcaption data-astro-cid-hvzlmnb7=\"\">Each agent sends tool calls only to its paired runner. The runner executes them on its own machine.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div>"}